        <td>No</td>
      </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="payment-gateways">Payment Gateway Integrations</h2>

  <p>
    The payment methods you offer directly impact how fast you get paid. Here's what
    each tool supports:
  </p>

  <h3>Payment Methods by Platform</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>FreshBooks:</strong> Stripe, PayPal, cards, bank transfer (ACH)</li>
    <li><strong>Invoice Ninja:</strong> Stripe, PayPal, Authorize.net, Braintree, and 40+ gateways</li>
    <li><strong>Bonsai:</strong> Stripe, PayPal, ACH</li>
    <li><strong>HoneyBook:</strong> Stripe (built-in), bank transfer</li>
    <li><strong>PayPal:</strong> PayPal, cards (via PayPal)</li>
    <li><strong>Square:</strong> Square, Cash App, Afterpay</li>
    <li><strong>Zoho Invoice:</strong> PayPal, Stripe, Authorize.net, and more</li>
    <li><strong>Harvest:</strong> Stripe, PayPal</li>
  </ul>

