  <h2 id="automation-features">Automation Features</h2>

  <h3>Automatic Payment Reminders</h3>
  <p>
    Set it and forget it. The best tools send reminders without your intervention:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Before due date:</strong> "Your invoice is due in 3 days"</li>
    <li><strong>On due date:</strong> "Your payment is due today"</li>
    <li><strong>After due date:</strong> "Your invoice is 7 days overdue"</li>
    <li><strong>Escalation:</strong> Increasingly firm reminders over time</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Recurring Invoices</h3>
  <p>
    Perfect for retainer clients or subscription services. Create once, sends automatically:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Set frequency (weekly, monthly, quarterly)</li>
    <li>Choose number of occurrences or ongoing</li>
    <li>Auto-charge saved payment methods (some tools)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Late Fee Automation</h3>
  <p>
    Some tools automatically add late fees based on your policies:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Percentage-based (1.5% per month)</li>
    <li>Flat fee ($25 late fee)</li>
    <li>Automatic application to overdue invoices</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="multi-currency">Multi-Currency Support</h2>

  <p>
    Working with international clients? Multi-currency invoicing is essential:
  </p>

  <h3>Best Multi-Currency Support</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Invoice Ninja:</strong> 90+ currencies, automatic exchange rates</li>
    <li><strong>Zoho Invoice:</strong> 180+ currencies, multi-currency reports</li>
    <li><strong>FreshBooks:</strong> Bill in any currency, client-specific defaults</li>
    <li><strong>Xero:</strong> Advanced multi-currency accounting</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Key Multi-Currency Features</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Invoice in client's local currency</li>
    <li>Receive payment in your preferred currency</li>
    <li>Automatic exchange rate updates</li>
    <li>Track realized gains/losses (for accounting)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <FAQSection faqs={faqData}/>

  <h2>Our Recommendations</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Best Overall:</strong> FreshBooks — Professional, fast payments, great UX</li>
    <li><strong>Best Free:</strong> Invoice Ninja — Full features, no cost</li>
    <li><strong>Best for Contracts:</strong> Bonsai — Contracts, proposals, and invoicing together</li>
    <li><strong>Best for Creatives:</strong> HoneyBook — Beautiful client experience</li>
    <li><strong>Best for Hourly:</strong> Harvest — Time tracking built for invoicing</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Choose based on your primary need: FreshBooks for professional invoicing, Bonsai if
    contracts matter, HoneyBook for client relationships, or Harvest if time tracking
    is central to your workflow.
  </p>

  <RelatedArticles articles={relatedArticles}/>
